<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-IBSA Australia market survey details.</title>
<headline>RTRS-IBSA Australia market survey details.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are details of the survey of Australian economic forecasts conducted by the International Banks and Securities Association on September 25.</p>
<p>		   A$ vs US$   90 Bills    10 yr Bond  Inflation</p>
<p>		   Dec  March  Dec  March  Dec  March  Dec  March</p>
<p>BBL Australia  78.0 80.0   7.00 7.00   8.00 8.00   2.50 3.00</p>
<p>Bankers Trust  77.0 77.0   6.50 6.50   7.90 8.00   1.50 1.80</p>
<p>Citibank	 80.0 83.0   6.50 6.90   7.70 8.25   1.60 1.60</p>
<p>Deutsche/Bain  80.0 81.0   6.75 6.75   7.25 7.50   1.40 1.60</p>
<p>Dresdner	 80.0 82.0   7.10 7.10   8.50 8.30   1.80 1.90</p>
<p>Macquarie	80.0 80.0   6.50 6.50   8.00 7.75   1.90 2.00</p>
<p>Rothschild     76.0 78.0   6.50 6.60   7.25 7.60   1.90 2.10</p>
<p>SBC Warburg    75.0 72.0   6.80 7.25   8.50 9.25   1.90 2.10</p>
<p>Sanwa	    78.0 80.0   6.55 6.75   7.75 7.75   2.60 2.80</p>
<p>Tokai	    77.0 75.0   6.70 6.50   7.50 7.00   2.30 2.00</p>
<p>UBS Australia  77.0 76.0   6.50 6.50   7.50 8.00   1.90 2.20</p>
<p>NOTE: IBSA represents foreign financial institutions in Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
